(3) Is at the level of granularity deemed necessary for tracking and reporting;
(4) Includes organization-defined information deemed necessary to achieve effective property accountability; and
(5) Is available for review and audit by designated organizational personnel.', 'Current asset inventory export covering technology assets, applications, services and data with owner, location, criticality and authorization status; reconciliation records showing inventory updates from discovery tools or CMDB; periodic review sign-off confirming the inventory is complete and available for audit.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-002', 'OT', 'Asset Management', 'Asset Governance', 'Mechanisms exist to facilitate an IT Asset Management (ITAM) program to implement and manage asset management controls.', 'Approved IT/OT asset management policy defining lifecycle ownership, inventory responsibilities and required asset attributes; asset governance meeting minutes or dashboard showing exceptions and remediation; evidence that asset management controls are reviewed and updated by accountable owners.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-003', 'OT', 'Asset Management', 'Asset-Service Dependencies', 'Mechanisms exist to identify and assess the security of Technology Assets, Applications and/or Services (TAAS) that support more than one critical business function.', 'Dependency mapping showing which critical business functions rely on each technology asset, application or service; service impact analysis or architecture diagram showing shared dependencies; review records confirming critical dependencies are assessed during risk, change and continuity planning.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-004', 'OT', 'Asset Management', 'Stakeholder Identification & Involvement', 'Mechanisms exist to identify and involve pertinent stakeholders of critical Technology Assets, Applications, Services and/or Data (TAASD) to support the ongoing secure management of those assets.', 'Stakeholder register identifying system owners, business owners, OT operations, security, engineering and support teams for critical assets; RACI matrix or approval workflow showing stakeholder involvement; meeting minutes or review approvals evidencing participation in secure asset management decisions.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-005', 'OT', 'Asset Management', 'Decommissioning', 'Mechanisms exist to ensure Technology Assets, Applications and/or Services (TAAS) are properly decommissioned so that data is properly transitioned to new systems or archived in accordance with applicable organizational standards, as well as statutory, regulatory and contractual obligations.', 'Approved decommissioning or secure disposal procedure covering data sanitization, access removal and asset retirement; completed decommissioning checklist for retired systems or devices; disposal certificate, wipe record or transfer approval proving assets were securely removed from service.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-006', 'OT', 'Asset Management', 'Automated Unauthorized Component Detection', 'Automated mechanisms exist to detect and alert upon the detection of unauthorized hardware, software and firmware components.', 'Automated discovery or network monitoring report identifying authorized and unauthorized devices or software; exception/remediation tickets for unapproved components; periodic review evidence showing unauthorized components are investigated, removed or formally approved.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-007', 'OT', 'Asset Management', 'Network Diagrams & Data Flow Diagrams (DFDs)', 'Mechanisms exist to maintain network architecture diagrams that: 
(1) Contain sufficient detail to assess the security of the network''s architecture;
(2) Reflect the current architecture of the network environment; and
(3) Document all sensitive/regulated data flows.', 'Approved network diagrams and data flow diagrams showing IT, OT, third-party and critical system connections; version history showing diagrams are maintained after changes; validation evidence from architecture reviews or firewall reviews confirming diagrams reflect the live environment.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-008', 'OT', 'Asset Management', 'Updates During Installations / Removals', 'Mechanisms exist to update asset inventories as part of component installations, removals and asset upgrades.', 'Current asset inventory export covering technology assets, applications, services and data with owner, location, criticality and authorization status; reconciliation records showing inventory updates from discovery tools or CMDB; periodic review sign-off confirming the inventory is complete and available for audit.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-009', 'OT', 'Asset Management', 'Component Duplication Avoidance', 'Mechanisms exist to establish and maintain an authoritative source and repository to provide a trusted source and accountability for approved and implemented system components that prevents assets from being duplicated in other asset inventories.', 'Current asset inventory export covering technology assets, applications, services and data with owner, location, criticality and authorization status; reconciliation records showing inventory updates from discovery tools or CMDB; periodic review sign-off confirming the inventory is complete and available for audit.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-010', 'OT', 'Asset Management', 'Configuration Management Database (CMDB)', 'Mechanisms exist to implement and manage a Configuration Management Database (CMDB), or similar technology, to monitor and govern technology asset-specific information.', 'CMDB export showing critical assets with owner, classification, location, support group, lifecycle status and dependencies; CMDB reconciliation report against discovery tools or asset inventory; change records showing CMDB updates are required when assets are added, modified or retired.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-011', 'OT', 'Asset Management', 'Asset Ownership Assignment', 'Mechanisms exist to ensure asset ownership responsibilities are assigned, tracked and managed at a team, individual, or responsible organization level to establish a common understanding of requirements for asset protection.', 'Asset ownership register assigning business, technical and security owners for critical assets; access or change approval records referencing assigned owners; periodic attestation confirming owner and accountability details remain accurate.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-012', 'OT', 'Asset Management', 'Accountability Information', 'Mechanisms exist to include capturing the name, position and/or role of individuals responsible/accountable for administering assets as part of the technology asset inventory process.', 'Asset ownership register assigning business, technical and security owners for critical assets; access or change approval records referencing assigned owners; periodic attestation confirming owner and accountability details remain accurate.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-013', 'OT', 'Asset Management', 'Asset Scope Classification', 'Mechanisms exist to determine security, compliance and resilience control applicability by identifying, assigning and documenting the appropriate asset scope categorization for all Technology Assets, Applications and/or Services (TAAS) and personnel (internal and third-parties).', 'Asset classification standard defining scope, criticality and protection requirements; inventory extract showing classification values for systems, applications and data; review evidence confirming critical assets are correctly classified for security, continuity and risk treatment.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-014', 'OT', 'Asset Management', 'Secure Disposal, Destruction or Re-Use of Equipment', 'Mechanisms exist to securely dispose of, destroy or repurpose system components using organization-defined techniques and methods to prevent information being recovered from these components.', 'Approved decommissioning or secure disposal procedure covering data sanitization, access removal and asset retirement; completed decommissioning checklist for retired systems or devices; disposal certificate, wipe record or transfer approval proving assets were securely removed from service.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-015', 'OT', 'Asset Management', 'Logical Tampering Protection', 'Mechanisms exist to assess the integrity of critical Technology Assets, Applications and/or Services (TAAS) to detect evidence of tampering, where:
