        ('CII-CID-307', 'OT', 'Incident Response', 'Incident Response Operations', 'Mechanisms exist to implement and govern processes and documentation to facilitate an organization-wide response capability for cybersecurity and data protection-related incidents.', 'Incident response plan or playbook defining roles, escalation paths and response steps for incident response operations; sample incident tickets, investigation notes or forensic records showing the process was followed; post-incident report and corrective action tracker proving lessons learned are captured and remediated.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-308', 'OT', 'Incident Response', 'Incident Handling', 'Mechanisms exist to cover:
(1) Preparation;
(2) Automated event detection or manual incident report intake;
(3) Analysis;
(4) Containment;
(5) Eradication; and
(6) Recovery.', 'Incident response plan or playbook defining roles, escalation paths and response steps for incident handling; sample incident tickets, investigation notes or forensic records showing the process was followed; post-incident report and corrective action tracker proving lessons learned are captured and remediated.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-309', 'OT', 'Incident Response', 'Incident Classification & Prioritization', 'Mechanisms exist to identify classes of incidents and actions to take to ensure the continuation of organizational missions and business functions.', 'Asset classification standard defining scope, criticality and protection requirements; inventory extract showing classification values for systems, applications and data; review evidence confirming critical assets are correctly classified for security, continuity and risk treatment.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-310', 'OT', 'Incident Response', 'Indicators of Compromise (IOC)', 'Mechanisms exist to define specific Indicators of Compromise (IOC) to identify the signs of potential cybersecurity events.', 'Incident response plan or playbook defining roles, escalation paths and response steps for indicators of compromise (ioc); sample incident tickets, investigation notes or forensic records showing the process was followed; post-incident report and corrective action tracker proving lessons learned are captured and remediated.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-311', 'OT', 'Incident Response', 'Incident Response Plan (IRP)', 'Mechanisms exist to maintain and make available a current and viable Incident Response Plan (IRP) to all stakeholders.', 'Stakeholder register identifying system owners, business owners, OT operations, security, engineering and support teams for critical assets; RACI matrix or approval workflow showing stakeholder involvement; meeting minutes or review approvals evidencing participation in secure asset management decisions.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-312', 'OT', 'Incident Response', 'IRP Update', 'Mechanisms exist to regularly review and modify incident response practices to incorporate lessons learned, business process changes and industry developments, as necessary.', 'Business impact analysis documenting approved RTO and RPO for critical business and operational services; recovery strategy mapping systems to required recovery objectives; test results or exercise reports demonstrating whether actual recovery performance meets the approved targets.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-313', 'OT', 'Incident Response', 'Incident Response Training', 'Mechanisms exist to train personnel in their incident response roles and responsibilities.', 'HR security procedure defining personnel security requirements for incident response training, including onboarding, role changes and termination responsibilities; completed onboarding/offboarding checklists, background screening records or access removal tickets; periodic HR/security reconciliation showing personnel changes are reflected in access and training records.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-314', 'OT', 'Incident Response', 'Incident Response Testing', 'Mechanisms exist to formally test incident response capabilities through realistic exercises to determine the operational effectiveness of those capabilities.', 'Contingency exercise plan covering realistic outage, cyber and operational disruption scenarios; completed tabletop or technical exercise reports with participants, results and timing; action tracker showing lessons learned, owners and closure of identified recovery gaps.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-315', 'OT', 'Incident Response', 'Integrated Security Incident Response Team (ISIRT)', 'Mechanisms exist to establish an integrated team of cybersecurity, IT and business function representatives that are capable of addressing cybersecurity and data protection incident response operations.', 'Incident response plan or playbook defining roles, escalation paths and response steps for integrated security incident response team (isirt); sample incident tickets, investigation notes or forensic records showing the process was followed; post-incident report and corrective action tracker proving lessons learned are captured and remediated.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-316', 'OT', 'Incident Response', 'Chain of Custody & Forensics', 'Mechanisms exist to perform digital forensics and maintain the integrity of the chain of custody, in accordance with applicable laws, regulations and industry-recognized secure practices.', 'Incident response plan or playbook defining roles, escalation paths and response steps for chain of custody & forensics; sample incident tickets, investigation notes or forensic records showing the process was followed; post-incident report and corrective action tracker proving lessons learned are captured and remediated.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-317', 'OT', 'Incident Response', 'Situational Awareness For Incidents', 'Mechanisms exist to document, monitor and report the status of cybersecurity and data protection incidents to internal stakeholders all the way through the resolution of the incident.', 'Stakeholder register identifying system owners, business owners, OT operations, security, engineering and support teams for critical assets; RACI matrix or approval workflow showing stakeholder involvement; meeting minutes or review approvals evidencing participation in secure asset management decisions.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-318', 'OT', 'Incident Response', 'Incident Stakeholder Reporting', 'Mechanisms exist to timely-report incidents to applicable:
