        ('CII-CID-319', 'OT', 'Incident Response', 'Cyber Incident Reporting for Sensitive / Regulated Data', 'Mechanisms exist to report sensitive/regulated data incidents in a timely manner.', 'Incident response plan or playbook defining roles, escalation paths and response steps for cyber incident reporting for sensitive / regulated data; sample incident tickets, investigation notes or forensic records showing the process was followed; post-incident report and corrective action tracker proving lessons learned are captured and remediated.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-320', 'OT', 'Incident Response', 'Supply Chain Coordination', 'Mechanisms exist to provide cybersecurity and data protection incident information to the provider of the Technology Assets, Applications and/or Services (TAAS) and other organizations involved in the supply chain for TAAS related to the incident.', 'Monitoring requirement or logging standard defining events, sources, retention and alerting for supply chain coordination; SIEM/log management dashboards or alert rules showing collection and correlation are enabled; investigation tickets, review reports or tuning records proving alerts are monitored and acted upon.', 'seed_script'),
