        ('CII-CID-322', 'OT', 'Incident Response', 'Root Cause Analysis (RCA) & Lessons Learned', 'Mechanisms exist to incorporate lessons learned from analyzing and resolving cybersecurity and data protection incidents to reduce the likelihood or impact of future incidents.', 'Business impact analysis documenting approved RTO and RPO for critical business and operational services; recovery strategy mapping systems to required recovery objectives; test results or exercise reports demonstrating whether actual recovery performance meets the approved targets.', 'seed_script'),
