(5) Is available for review and audit by designated organizational personnel.', 'Asset inventory export, asset register fields, discovery scan report, CMDB reconciliation, ownership fields, periodic inventory review and exception remediation tracker.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-595', 'IT', 'Asset Management', 'Asset Ownership Assignment', 'Mechanisms exist to ensure asset ownership responsibilities are assigned, tracked and managed at a team, individual, or responsible organization level to establish a common understanding of requirements for asset protection.', 'Asset owner/custodian assignment records, RACI matrix, ownership approval workflow, periodic ownership attestation and asset register updates.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-596', 'IT', 'Asset Management', 'Network Diagrams & Data Flow Diagrams (DFDs)', 'Mechanisms exist to maintain network architecture diagrams that: 
