        ('CII-CID-597', 'IT', 'Asset Management', 'Security of Assets & Media', 'Mechanisms exist to maintain strict control over the internal or external distribution of any kind of sensitive/regulated media.', 'Media handling procedure, removable media register, media issuance/return records, encryption configuration, secure transfer records, chain-of-custody logs and media storage access records.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-598', 'IT', 'Asset Management', 'Unattended End-User Equipment', 'Mechanisms exist to implement enhanced protection measures for unattended technology assets to protect against tampering and unauthorized access.', 'Endpoint lock/screen-timeout configuration, MDM/GPO compliance report, device encryption status, endpoint hardening baseline, unattended equipment spot-check results and user acknowledgement.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-599', 'IT', 'Asset Management', 'Secure Disposal, Destruction or Re-Use of Equipment', 'Mechanisms exist to securely dispose of, destroy or repurpose system components using organization-defined techniques and methods to prevent information being recovered from these components.', 'Asset decommissioning form, media sanitization procedure, disk wiping report, certificate of destruction, disposal approval and asset register update evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-600', 'IT', 'Asset Management', 'Return of Assets', 'Mechanisms exist to ensure that employees and third-party users return all organizational assets in their possession upon termination of employment, contract or agreement.', 'Asset decommissioning form, media sanitization procedure, disk wiping report, certificate of destruction, disposal approval and asset register update evidence.', 'seed_script');
