        ('CII-CID-604', 'IT', 'Asset Management', 'Microphones & Web Cameras', 'Mechanisms exist to configure assets to prohibit the use of endpoint-based microphones and web cameras in secure areas or where sensitive/regulated information is discussed.', 'Restricted device standard, approved device list, endpoint control configuration, exception approvals, travel device issuance/return records and monitoring alerts.', 'seed_script'),
