        ('CII-CID-610', 'IT', 'Asset Management', 'Authorized To Connect', 'Mechanisms exist to maintain a list of Technology Asset, Application and/or Service (TAAS) that are authorized to connect to organizational Technology Assets, Applications, Services and/or Data (TAASD).', 'Authorized device connection standard, approved asset inventory, NAC/connection approval records, unauthorized device alerts and remediation tickets.', 'seed_script'),
