(3) Readily-available.', 'Compliance obligation register, control assessment plan, internal/external audit reports, evidence repository, non-compliance register and corrective action closure.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1165', 'IT', 'Embedded Technology', 'Dual Approval For High-Impact Environments', 'Mechanisms exist to require dual approval for any changes that might result in a serious incident that could adversely impact:
(1) Business processes; and/or
(2) Technology Assets, Applications, Services and/or Data (TAASD).', 'Embedded technology inventory, interface control documentation, configuration monitoring logs, certificate/authentication records, maintenance records and safety/security assessment.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1166', 'IT', 'Embedded Technology', 'Interface Security', 'Mechanisms exist to protect embedded devices against unauthorized use of the physical factory diagnostic and test interface(s).', 'Embedded technology inventory, interface control documentation, configuration monitoring logs, certificate/authentication records, maintenance records and safety/security assessment.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1167', 'IT', 'Embedded Technology', 'Embedded Technology Configuration Monitoring', 'Mechanisms exist to generate log entries on embedded devices when configuration changes or attempts to access interfaces are detected.', 'Embedded technology inventory, interface control documentation, configuration monitoring logs, certificate/authentication records, maintenance records and safety/security assessment.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1168', 'IT', 'Embedded Technology', 'Embedded Technology Maintenance', 'Mechanisms exist to securely update software and upgrade functionality on embedded devices.', 'Embedded technology inventory, interface control documentation, configuration monitoring logs, certificate/authentication records, maintenance records and safety/security assessment.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1169', 'IT', 'Embedded Technology', 'Power Level Monitoring', 'Automated mechanisms exist to monitor the power levels of embedded technologies for decreased or excessive power usage, including battery drainage, to investigate for device tampering.', 'Embedded technology inventory, interface control documentation, configuration monitoring logs, certificate/authentication records, maintenance records and safety/security assessment.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1170', 'IT', 'Embedded Technology', 'Authorized Communications', 'Mechanisms exist to restrict embedded technologies to communicate only with authorized peers and service endpoints.', 'Embedded technology inventory, interface control documentation, configuration monitoring logs, certificate/authentication records, maintenance records and safety/security assessment.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1171', 'IT', 'Embedded Technology', 'Safety Assessment', 'Mechanisms exist to evaluate the safety aspects of embedded technologies via a fault tree analysis, or similar method, to determine possible consequences of misuse, misconfiguration and/or failure.', 'Embedded technology inventory, interface control documentation, configuration monitoring logs, certificate/authentication records, maintenance records and safety/security assessment.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1172', 'IT', 'Embedded Technology', 'Certificate-Based Authentication', 'Mechanisms exist to enforce certificate-based authentication for embedded technologies (e.g., IoT, OT, etc.) and their supporting services.', 'Embedded technology inventory, interface control documentation, configuration monitoring logs, certificate/authentication records, maintenance records and safety/security assessment.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1173', 'IT', 'Embedded Technology', 'Chip-To-Cloud Security', 'Mechanisms exist to implement embedded technologies that utilize pre-provisioned cloud trust anchors to support secure bootstrap and Zero Touch Provisioning (ZTP).', 'Embedded technology inventory, interface control documentation, configuration monitoring logs, certificate/authentication records, maintenance records and safety/security assessment.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1174', 'IT', 'Embedded Technology', 'Safe Operations', 'Mechanisms exist to continuously validate autonomous systems that trigger an automatic state change when safe operation is no longer assured.', 'Embedded technology inventory, interface control documentation, configuration monitoring logs, certificate/authentication records, maintenance records and safety/security assessment.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1175', 'IT', 'Physical & Environmental Security', 'Physical Access Authorizations', 'Physical access control mechanisms exist to maintain a current list of personnel with authorized access to organizational facilities (except for those areas within the facility officially designated as publicly accessible).', 'Physical access policy, badge/access logs, visitor register, CCTV/alarm records, environmental monitoring reports, access review and exception approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1176', 'IT', 'Physical & Environmental Security', 'Physical Access Control', 'Physical access control mechanisms exist to enforce physical access authorizations for all physical access points (including designated entry/exit points) to facilities (excluding those areas within the facility officially designated as publicly accessible).', 'Physical access policy, badge/access logs, visitor register, CCTV/alarm records, environmental monitoring reports, access review and exception approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1177', 'IT', 'Physical & Environmental Security', 'Monitoring Physical Access', 'Physical access control mechanisms exist to monitor for, detect and respond to physical security incidents.', 'Physical access policy, badge/access logs, visitor register, CCTV/alarm records, environmental monitoring reports, access review and exception approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1178', 'IT', 'Physical & Environmental Security', 'Temperature & Humidity Controls', 'Facility security mechanisms exist to maintain and monitor temperature and humidity levels within the facility.', 'Physical access policy, badge/access logs, visitor register, CCTV/alarm records, environmental monitoring reports, access review and exception approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1179', 'IT', 'Physical & Environmental Security', 'Physical Access Device Inventories', 'Mechanisms exist to maintain an accurate inventory of all physical access devices (e.g., RFID cards, access fobs, door keys, etc.).', 'Physical access policy, badge/access logs, visitor register, CCTV/alarm records, environmental monitoring reports, access review and exception approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1180', 'IT', 'Physical & Environmental Security', 'Controlled Ingress & Egress Points', 'Physical access control mechanisms exist to limit and monitor physical access through controlled ingress and egress points.', 'Physical access policy, badge/access logs, visitor register, CCTV/alarm records, environmental monitoring reports, access review and exception approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1181', 'IT', 'Physical & Environmental Security', 'Intrusion Alarms / Surveillance Equipment', 'Physical access control mechanisms exist to monitor physical intrusion alarms and surveillance equipment.', 'Physical access policy, badge/access logs, visitor register, CCTV/alarm records, environmental monitoring reports, access review and exception approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1182', 'IT', 'Physical & Environmental Security', 'Access Control for Output Devices', 'Physical security mechanisms exist to restrict access to printers and other system output devices to prevent unauthorized individuals from obtaining the output.', 'Physical access policy, badge/access logs, visitor register, CCTV/alarm records, environmental monitoring reports, access review and exception approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1183', 'IT', 'Information Security Governance', 'Information Security Roles & Responsibilities', 'Mechanisms exist to define, assign and maintain information security roles, responsibilities, accountability, segregation of duties and conflict-of-interest safeguards across the entity.', 'RACI matrix, role appointment letters, job descriptions, security responsibility acknowledgements, delegated authority records and periodic role review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1184', 'IT', 'Information Security Governance', 'Board and Executive Security Oversight', 'Mechanisms exist for the board, CEO or equivalent executive leadership to accept responsibility for information security, oversee the information security program and review risk assessment outcomes.', 'Board/executive cyber oversight terms of reference, board papers, meeting minutes, risk reports, approval decisions and action tracking evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1185', 'IT', 'Information Security Governance', 'Information Security Steering Committee', 'Mechanisms exist to establish an information security steering committee to supervise the information security management system, approve policies, review risks, monitor incidents and ensure corrective actions.', 'Steering committee charter, meeting agenda/minutes, risk and exception approval records, action tracker, management decisions and closure evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1186', 'IT', 'Information Security Governance', 'Senior Management Security Responsibilities', 'Mechanisms exist for senior management to identify asset criticality, review access privileges, support technical testing, report security compromises and incorporate security requirements into projects and contracts.', 'RACI matrix, role appointment letters, job descriptions, security responsibility acknowledgements, delegated authority records and periodic role review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1187', 'IT', 'Information Security Governance', 'Dedicated Information Security Function', 'Mechanisms exist to allocate information security governance responsibility to a qualified and independent person or team with authority to maintain the security program and report implementation status.', 'RACI matrix, role appointment letters, job descriptions, security responsibility acknowledgements, delegated authority records and periodic role review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1188', 'IT', 'Information Security Governance', 'Employee and Third-Party Security Responsibilities', 'Mechanisms exist to ensure employees and third-party users understand, agree to and comply with information security responsibilities, acceptable use requirements and incident reporting obligations.', 'RACI matrix, role appointment letters, job descriptions, security responsibility acknowledgements, delegated authority records and periodic role review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1189', 'IT', 'Information Security Governance', 'Information Security Champions', 'Mechanisms exist to assign information security champions or coordinators across business functions to support control implementation, awareness, risk assessment and incident resolution activities.', 'RACI matrix, role appointment letters, job descriptions, security responsibility acknowledgements, delegated authority records and periodic role review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1190', 'IT', 'Audit & Assurance', 'Independent Security Audit Responsibility', 'Mechanisms exist to assign independent internal audit or external audit responsibility for assessing the effectiveness of information security regulation implementation and protecting audit tools and records.', 'Audit plan, audit scope, evidence request list, audit reports, findings register, management responses and corrective action closure.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1191', 'IT', 'Policy & Standards Management', 'Information Security Policy', 'Mechanisms exist to develop, approve, publish, communicate and maintain an entity-wide information security policy that defines principles for protecting information assets and addressing security threats and business risks.', 'Approved policy/standard document, owner and approver record, version history, publication/communication evidence, annual review and approval sign-off.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1192', 'IT', 'Policy & Standards Management', 'Security Policy Alignment with Strategy and DESC Requirements', 'Mechanisms exist to align information security policies with entity strategy, DESC-issued standards and cyber resilience requirements, including adoption of zero trust principles where applicable.', 'Approved policy/standard document, owner and approver record, version history, publication/communication evidence, annual review and approval sign-off.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1193', 'IT', 'Policy & Standards Management', 'Information Security Policy Review', 'Mechanisms exist to review the information security policy at least annually and upon significant change, and to report updates to the steering committee and executive leadership.', 'Approved policy/standard document, owner and approver record, version history, publication/communication evidence, annual review and approval sign-off.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1194', 'IT', 'Policy & Standards Management', 'Technical and Operational Security Policies', 'Mechanisms exist to develop, distribute, maintain and periodically review technical and operational security policies, procedures and guidelines based on risk assessment results.', 'Governance charter, RACI matrix, committee minutes, approved policies, decision register, exception approvals and management action tracker.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1195', 'IT', 'Security Awareness & Training', 'Information Security Awareness Program', 'Mechanisms exist to design and implement role-based information security awareness and training programs covering entity policies, security risks, user responsibilities and public awareness where relevant.', 'Awareness/training plan, training materials, attendance records, phishing simulation results, knowledge communications and effectiveness survey results.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1196', 'IT', 'Security Awareness & Training', 'Awareness Effectiveness Measurement', 'Mechanisms exist to measure awareness effectiveness, maintain training attendance records and improve awareness activities based on survey results and observed security behaviours.', 'Awareness/training plan, training materials, attendance records, phishing simulation results, knowledge communications and effectiveness survey results.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1197', 'IT', 'Information Protection', 'Confidentiality and Non-Disclosure Agreements', 'Mechanisms exist to establish, review and enforce confidentiality or non-disclosure agreements for employees and external parties to protect government and entity information from internal or external leakage.', 'Data protection policy, classification register, encryption/DLP configuration, access controls, data discovery results and data protection review records.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1198', 'IT', 'External Relations & Threat Intelligence', 'Security Authority and Interest Group Contacts', 'Mechanisms exist to maintain appropriate contacts with security authorities, judicial authorities, cybersecurity forums and professional groups to support incident handling and current threat awareness.', 'Threat catalog, threat analysis worksheets, behavior baseline reports, detection rules, anomaly review records and control improvement actions.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1199', 'IT', 'Third Party Security', 'Securing External Party Relationships', 'Mechanisms exist to assess information security risks from external parties, select appropriate controls and incorporate confidentiality, integrity, availability and compliance requirements into contracts and agreements.', 'Third-party management procedure, vendor inventory, due diligence records, contractual security clauses, monitoring reports and review approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1200', 'IT', 'Asset Management', 'Information Asset Management Policy and Register', 'Mechanisms exist to identify, document and maintain a register of critical information assets and related processing facilities, including classification, location, license details, business value and recovery-relevant information.', 'Asset inventory export, asset register fields, discovery scan report, CMDB reconciliation, ownership fields, periodic inventory review and exception remediation tracker.', 'seed_script');
    INSERT INTO Control_Library (ControlCode, ITOT, Domain, ControlName, ControlDescription, SampleEvidence, CreatedBy) VALUES
        ('CII-CID-1201', 'IT', 'Asset Management', 'Information Asset Ownership and Custodianship', 'Mechanisms exist to assign owners and custodians for information assets, define access control responsibilities and maintain operational accountability for asset handling and protection.', 'Asset owner/custodian assignment records, RACI matrix, ownership approval workflow, periodic ownership attestation and asset register updates.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1202', 'IT', 'Data Classification & Handling', 'Information Asset Classification', 'Mechanisms exist to define, implement and maintain an information classification scheme based on asset criticality, value, legal requirements and protection requirements.', 'Data classification policy, classification scheme, labeled sample records, asset/data classification register, owner approvals and periodic classification review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1203', 'IT', 'Data Classification & Handling', 'Information Labeling and Handling', 'Mechanisms exist to define and apply labeling, handling, storage and distribution controls for electronic and physical information assets according to classification requirements.', 'Information labeling procedure, label templates, sample labeled records, handling instructions, distribution controls and user communication/training evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1204', 'IT', 'Data Protection', 'Secure Disposal of Information and Assets', 'Mechanisms exist to securely dispose of information and information assets based on their value, criticality and sensitivity, and to maintain disposal records for critical or classified information.', 'Retention schedule, data retention configuration, disposal logs, legal hold records, retention exception approvals and periodic retention review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1205', 'IT', 'Acceptable Use', 'Acceptable Use of Information Assets', 'Mechanisms exist to establish acceptable use requirements governing the use of information, systems, assets and personal devices within the entity environment.', 'Acceptable use policy, signed user acknowledgements, awareness communication, monitoring/violation records and corrective action evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1206', 'IT', 'Data Protection & Privacy', 'Critical and Classified Data Protection', 'Mechanisms exist to identify critical or classified data exposure, control processing, storage and sharing boundaries, and implement protection, masking, synthetic data and privacy controls for advanced technologies and automated response systems.', 'Data protection policy, classification register, encryption/DLP configuration, access controls, data discovery results and data protection review records.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1207', 'IT', 'Risk Management', 'Risk Assessment Methodology and Planning', 'Mechanisms exist to develop a risk assessment methodology, define risk acceptance criteria, plan periodic assessments, determine scope and include threat and vulnerability information in the risk assessment process.', 'Risk assessment methodology, assessment worksheets, asset/threat/vulnerability analysis, risk scoring, stakeholder review and approval records.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1208', 'IT', 'Risk Management', 'Threat Data and Threat Intelligence in Risk Assessment', 'Mechanisms exist to collect, analyze and use threat data, vulnerabilities and threat intelligence related to critical information and assets as part of the risk assessment process.', 'Risk assessment methodology, assessment worksheets, asset/threat/vulnerability analysis, risk scoring, stakeholder review and approval records.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1209', 'IT', 'Risk Management', 'Risk Assessment Execution', 'Mechanisms exist to conduct, maintain and document detailed risk assessments, prioritize risks by criticality and obtain approval for high risks from the steering committee or top management.', 'Risk assessment methodology, assessment worksheets, asset/threat/vulnerability analysis, risk scoring, stakeholder review and approval records.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1210', 'IT', 'Risk Management', 'Risk Treatment and Mitigation', 'Mechanisms exist to select, authorize, implement, monitor and review risk treatment plans and mitigating controls for identified information security risks.', 'Risk methodology, risk assessment report, risk register, treatment plans, residual risk approvals and risk review minutes.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1211', 'IT', 'Risk Management', 'Residual Risk Acceptance', 'Mechanisms exist to document residual non-treated risks with justifications and obtain sign-off from the steering committee or top management with planned treatment actions.', 'Risk methodology, risk assessment report, risk register, treatment plans, residual risk approvals and risk review minutes.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1212', 'IT', 'Incident Response', 'Incident Management Planning', 'Mechanisms exist to establish incident management policies, procedures, response capability, severity categorization, DESC reporting requirements, testing and lessons learned activities.', 'Incident response plan/playbooks, incident classification matrix, responder roster, incident tickets, communication logs and lessons learned reports.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1213', 'IT', 'Incident Response', 'Incident Reporting and Escalation', 'Mechanisms exist to require prompt reporting of observed or suspected information security incidents or weaknesses and to escalate high-severity incidents to relevant authorities when required.', 'Incident reporting procedure, escalation matrix, regulator/law enforcement contact list, notification records, management briefings and status reports.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1214', 'IT', 'Digital Forensics', 'Evidence Identification and Preservation', 'Mechanisms exist to identify, collect, retain and preserve evidence related to information security incidents in a manner that supports investigation and accountability.', 'Forensic procedure, evidence collection form, chain-of-custody log, forensic image/hash records, secure evidence storage records and investigation report.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1215', 'IT', 'Threat Intelligence & Knowledge Management', 'Incident Knowledge Base and External Threat Sources', 'Mechanisms exist to maintain a centralized incident knowledge base and gather external threat, vulnerability and attack-trend information to support analysis and preventive action planning.', 'Threat catalog, threat analysis worksheets, behavior baseline reports, detection rules, anomaly review records and control improvement actions.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1216', 'IT', 'Problem Management', 'Security Problem Management', 'Mechanisms exist to define and implement problem management processes covering detection, categorization, prioritization, diagnosis, investigation, resolution, lessons learned and improvements.', 'Root cause analysis report, problem record, corrective action plan, lessons learned minutes, remediation tickets and closure evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1217', 'IT', 'Identity & Access Management', 'Access Control Management Policy and Procedure', 'Mechanisms exist to establish access control policies and procedures covering least privilege, role-based access, third-party access and secure repositories of access control information.', 'Access control policy, user access matrix, access approvals, IAM configuration, access logs and periodic access review evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1218', 'IT', 'Identity & Access Management', 'User Registration and De-Registration', 'Mechanisms exist to register, de-register, modify, disable and remove user access privileges based on authorized business needs and approved access requests.', 'Joiner-mover-leaver procedure, access request tickets, HR trigger records, account creation/removal logs, deprovisioning evidence and leaver access termination report.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1219', 'IT', 'Identity & Access Management', 'Unique User Identification and Authentication', 'Mechanisms exist to provide unique user IDs, implement unified ID standards and enforce appropriate authentication policies and techniques for onsite and remote access.', 'Unique ID standard, IAM user export, duplicate/shared account review, account ownership records, authentication logs and periodic user account review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1220', 'IT', 'Privileged Access Management', 'Privileged Access Authorization and Monitoring', 'Mechanisms exist to restrict, authorize, record, monitor and periodically review special or high privileged access based on least privilege, separation of duties and strict authentication.', 'Privileged account inventory, PAM vault/session recording logs, privileged access approvals, break-glass register, privileged access review, admin activity logs and exception approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1221', 'IT', 'Network Security', 'Network Access Control', 'Mechanisms exist to authorize, activate, terminate, detect, identify and authenticate network connections and to manage access to network services and configuration ports.', 'NAC policy, device authentication configuration, approved device inventory, unauthorized device detection logs and remediation tickets.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1222', 'IT', 'Network Security', 'Network Segregation and External Connectivity Controls', 'Mechanisms exist to segregate internal, external, wireless, IP telephony and other networks and to implement security and operational controls for connections beyond direct entity control.', 'Network segmentation design, firewall/ACL rules, VLAN/security zone configuration, traffic flow review, segmentation test results and exception approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1223', 'IT', 'Operating System Security', 'Operating System Access Control', 'Mechanisms exist to manage operating system access through secure log-on, unique IDs, authentication, utility program control, session timeout, lockout policy and administrator log review.', 'Application/security requirements, architecture review, security test results, remediation tracker, change approval and production release sign-off.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1224', 'IT', 'Application Security', 'Application Access Control', 'Mechanisms exist to provide application access based on job responsibilities and business justification and to isolate highly critical information systems and application environments.', 'Application user access matrix, role/permission configuration, access request approvals, periodic application access review, privileged application access logs and isolation evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1225', 'IT', 'Remote Access Security', 'Remote Access Security', 'Mechanisms exist to authorize, authenticate, secure, monitor and periodically review remote access connections, VPN clients, remote working arrangements and access to authorized services.', 'Remote access policy, VPN/ZTNA configuration, MFA enforcement evidence, remote user access logs, device posture checks and periodic remote access review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1226', 'IT', 'Mobile Security', 'Mobile Computing and BYOD Security', 'Mechanisms exist to secure mobile computing and BYOD use through encryption, secure handling, lost-device wiping, backup procedures, authorized use restrictions and policy requirements.', 'BYOD policy, user agreement, MDM enrollment record, allowed applications list, device compliance evidence and exception approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1227', 'IT', 'Wireless Security', 'Wireless Access Management', 'Mechanisms exist to authorize, authenticate, restrict, secure and continuously monitor wireless access to entity networks and services.', 'Wireless access policy, approved SSID inventory, WPA/802.1X configuration, wireless access approvals, rogue AP scan results and wireless access logs.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1228', 'IT', 'Physical Security', 'Physical Access Control', 'Mechanisms exist to establish and implement physical access policies, procedures and safeguards for offices, rooms, facilities and other areas requiring protection.', 'Physical access policy, badge/access logs, visitor register, CCTV/alarm records, environmental monitoring reports, access review and exception approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1229', 'IT', 'External Access Control', 'Public and External Party Access Control', 'Mechanisms exist to control public and external party access to information, systems and facilities based on defined authorization, security and business requirements.', 'Access control policy, user access matrix, access approvals, IAM configuration, access logs and periodic access review evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1230', 'IT', 'Information Access Control', 'Information and Document Access Control', 'Mechanisms exist to control access to information and documents based on authorization, classification, business need and applicable handling requirements.', 'Access control policy, access request approvals, permission configuration screenshots, least-privilege review, periodic access recertification and access removal evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1231', 'IT', 'Access Review & Audit', 'Access Control Audit and Review', 'Mechanisms exist to periodically review and audit access rights, access control implementation, privileged access and exceptions to ensure access remains appropriate and authorized.', 'Access control policy, user access matrix, access approvals, IAM configuration, access logs and periodic access review evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1232', 'IT', 'Operations Security', 'Operations Management', 'Mechanisms exist to establish operational procedures, responsibilities, configuration controls, change controls and secure day-to-day operation of systems and services.', 'Operations procedure, operating runbooks, service monitoring records, exception logs, incident/problem tickets and operational review minutes.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1233', 'IT', 'Malware Protection', 'Protection Against Malicious and Mobile Code', 'Mechanisms exist to prevent, detect, contain and recover from malicious code, mobile code and malware through technical controls, user awareness and operational response procedures.', 'Endpoint device control policy, USB/port restriction configuration, application control rules, allowed executable list, block logs and exception approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1234', 'IT', 'Network Security', 'Network Security Management', 'Mechanisms exist to secure and manage networks, network services, network devices and communications to protect information confidentiality, integrity and availability.', 'Network security standard, network diagram, firewall/ACL configuration, network monitoring logs, exception approvals and periodic rule review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1235', 'IT', 'Information Exchange', 'Information Exchange Management', 'Mechanisms exist to protect information exchanged internally and externally through approved channels, secure transfer methods, agreements and handling procedures.', 'Data protection policy, classification register, encryption/DLP configuration, access controls, data discovery results and data protection review records.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1236', 'IT', 'Email Security', 'Electronic Messaging and Email Security', 'Mechanisms exist to secure electronic messaging and email usage through policy, protection controls, monitoring, awareness and handling of malicious or unauthorized messages.', 'Email security configuration, SPF/DKIM/DMARC/ARC records, email encryption/signing settings, quarantine reports, malicious email logs and exception reviews.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1237', 'IT', 'Digital Services Security', 'Online Transactions and Public Information Management', 'Mechanisms exist to protect online transactions, public-facing information and digital services from unauthorized modification, misuse, disclosure or service disruption.', 'Digital service security standard, public service inventory, transaction security configuration, content publishing approvals, monitoring logs and security test evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1238', 'IT', 'Media Handling', 'Media Handling Management', 'Mechanisms exist to control, protect, transport, store, dispose and track media containing information according to its classification and sensitivity.', 'Media handling procedure, removable media register, media issuance/return records, encryption configuration, secure transfer records, chain-of-custody logs and media storage access records.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1239', 'IT', 'Logging & Monitoring', 'Monitoring and Logs Management', 'Mechanisms exist to collect, retain, protect, review and monitor logs and security events to support detection, investigation, accountability and response.', 'Continuous monitoring strategy, log source coverage matrix, monitoring use cases, dashboards, alert review tickets and monitoring effectiveness reports.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1240', 'IT', 'Data Center Security', 'Data Center Security', 'Mechanisms exist to secure data centers and critical processing facilities through physical, environmental, operational and access control safeguards.', 'Physical access policy, badge/access logs, visitor register, CCTV/alarm records, environmental monitoring reports, access review and exception approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1241', 'IT', 'Digital Services Security', 'Digital Services Security', 'Mechanisms exist to secure digital services across their lifecycle, including design, implementation, operation, monitoring and protection from cyber threats.', 'Digital service security standard, public service inventory, transaction security configuration, content publishing approvals, monitoring logs and security test evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1242', 'IT', 'Social Media Security', 'Social Media Security', 'Mechanisms exist to govern, monitor and secure official social media use, access and content publishing to prevent unauthorized communications or compromise.', 'Official account inventory, account owner list, MFA configuration, publishing approval workflow, account activity logs and periodic account review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1243', 'IT', 'Business Continuity', 'Business Impact Analysis', 'Mechanisms exist to perform business impact analysis to identify critical processes, dependencies, impact tolerances, recovery priorities and continuity requirements.', 'Business impact analysis report, critical process list, dependency mapping, RTO/RPO approvals and management sign-off.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1244', 'IT', 'Business Continuity', 'Business Continuity Plan', 'Mechanisms exist to establish, maintain and communicate business continuity plans to sustain or recover critical business processes during disruptions.', 'Business continuity policy/plan, critical service recovery procedures, call tree, exercise results, plan review history and corrective action tracker.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1245', 'IT', 'Disaster Recovery', 'Disaster Recovery Planning', 'Mechanisms exist to define, maintain and execute disaster recovery capabilities for information systems, data and supporting infrastructure.', 'Disaster recovery plan, recovery runbooks, restore/failover test results, RTO/RPO evidence, recovery validation logs and lessons learned.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1246', 'IT', 'Backup & Recovery', 'Backup and Storage Strategies', 'Mechanisms exist to define and implement backup, storage, protection, restoration and verification strategies for critical information and systems.', 'Backup policy, backup schedules, backup job reports, immutable/offline backup configuration, restore test evidence and backup exception reports.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1247', 'IT', 'Business Continuity Testing', 'BCP Testing and Review', 'Mechanisms exist to test, review and update business continuity plans periodically and after major changes or incidents to ensure effectiveness.', 'Continuity/resilience plan, dependency analysis, recovery objectives, exercise results, review records and corrective action evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1248', 'IT', 'System Acquisition & Development', 'Information Systems Acquisition, Development and Management', 'Mechanisms exist to incorporate information security requirements into information systems acquisition, development and management activities.', 'Application/security requirements, architecture review, security test results, remediation tracker, change approval and production release sign-off.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1249', 'IT', 'System Security Requirements', 'Security Requirements and Specifications', 'Mechanisms exist to define, document and validate information security requirements and specifications for new or changed information systems.', 'Security requirements document, product security review, requirement traceability matrix, acceptance testing results and approval sign-off.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1250', 'IT', 'Secure Processing', 'Secure and Correct Processing', 'Mechanisms exist to ensure correct, complete, authorized and secure processing of information within applications and information systems.', 'Application/security requirements, architecture review, security test results, remediation tracker, change approval and production release sign-off.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1251', 'IT', 'Secure Development', 'Secure Source Code, Files and Test Data', 'Mechanisms exist to protect information system files, source code, test data and production data from unauthorized access, modification, disclosure or misuse.', 'Source code access review, repository permissions, branch protection settings, code review approvals, commit history and secret scanning results.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1252', 'IT', 'Change Management', 'Software Development Change Management', 'Mechanisms exist to manage changes in software development through authorization, testing, approval, segregation of duties, rollback and change records.', 'Change management procedure, change tickets, CAB approvals, implementation evidence, backout plans, testing results and post-implementation review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1253', 'IT', 'Security Testing', 'Security Testing', 'Mechanisms exist to conduct periodic and change-driven security testing of information systems to identify vulnerabilities and validate security controls.', 'Vulnerability management procedure, vulnerability register, scan schedule, remediation tracker, exception approvals and periodic program review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1254', 'IT', 'Release & Deployment', 'Secure Deployment', 'Mechanisms exist to control deployment of information systems and applications through approved release, installation, migration and post-deployment validation activities.', 'Release checklist, deployment approvals, secure deployment pipeline logs, release notes, rollback plan and production validation evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1255', 'IT', 'Cryptography', 'Cryptography Controls', 'Mechanisms exist to govern cryptographic controls, including approved algorithms, key management, encryption use and protection of sensitive information in storage and transit.', 'Cryptography policy, approved algorithm list, encryption configuration, cryptographic module validation, exception approvals and periodic crypto review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1256', 'IT', 'Physical & Environmental Security', 'Environmental and Physical Threat Protection', 'Mechanisms exist to protect facilities, working areas and equipment from environmental and physical threats and to periodically test physical and environmental safeguards.', 'Physical access policy, badge/access logs, visitor register, CCTV/alarm records, environmental monitoring reports, access review and exception approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1257', 'IT', 'Human Resources Security', 'Pre-Employment Security Controls', 'Mechanisms exist to perform pre-employment security screening and communicate security responsibilities before employment or engagement begins.', 'Background screening procedure, completed screening records, role risk criteria, pre-employment checklist and exception approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1258', 'IT', 'Human Resources Security', 'During-Employment Security Controls', 'Mechanisms exist to ensure personnel receive security awareness, comply with policies and remain accountable for information security responsibilities during employment.', 'Awareness/training plan, training materials, attendance records, phishing simulation results, knowledge communications and effectiveness survey results.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1259', 'IT', 'Human Resources Security', 'Termination and Change of Employment Controls', 'Mechanisms exist to manage termination or change of employment through timely access removal, asset return, confidentiality reminders and responsibility changes.', 'HR transfer/termination checklist, access revocation evidence, asset return records, exit certification and high-risk termination monitoring evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1260', 'IT', 'Compliance & Legal', 'Compliance with Legal Requirements', 'Mechanisms exist to identify, document and comply with applicable federal, local, contractual and regulatory information security requirements.', 'Legal/regulatory obligation register, compliance mapping, control owner attestation, legal review, evidence repository and exception register.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1261', 'IT', 'Compliance & Legal', 'Compliance Controls', 'Mechanisms exist to implement and monitor compliance controls to ensure adherence to applicable legal, regulatory and internal security requirements.', 'Compliance obligation register, control assessment plan, internal/external audit reports, evidence repository, non-compliance register and corrective action closure.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1262', 'IT', 'Privacy & Data Protection', 'Protection of Private Information', 'Mechanisms exist to protect private information of individuals and organizations through lawful processing, confidentiality, privacy controls and appropriate safeguards.', 'Data protection policy, classification register, encryption/DLP configuration, access controls, data discovery results and data protection review records.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1263', 'IT', 'Compliance Monitoring', 'Compliance with Security Policies and Standards', 'Mechanisms exist to monitor and verify compliance with information security policies, standards, procedures and approved control requirements.', 'Continuous monitoring strategy, log source coverage matrix, monitoring use cases, dashboards, alert review tickets and monitoring effectiveness reports.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1264', 'IT', 'Audit & Assurance', 'Audit of ISR Implementation', 'Mechanisms exist to audit the implementation and effectiveness of information security regulation requirements and track corrective actions to closure.', 'Audit plan, audit scope, evidence request list, audit reports, findings register, management responses and corrective action closure.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1265', 'IT', 'Security Metrics & Reporting', 'Information Security KPIs', 'Mechanisms exist to define, collect, monitor and report information security key performance indicators to measure implementation and effectiveness of the security program.', 'KPI definition sheet, dashboard screenshots, reporting packs, metric source data, trend analysis and management action tracker.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1266', 'IT', 'Security Metrics & Reporting', 'Information Security Dashboard', 'Mechanisms exist to maintain an information security dashboard providing management visibility into security posture, risks, incidents, KPIs and compliance status.', 'KPI definition sheet, dashboard screenshots, reporting packs, metric source data, trend analysis and management action tracker.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1267', 'IT', 'Cloud Security', 'Cloud Security Policy and Procedure', 'Mechanisms exist to define cloud security policies and procedures governing cloud adoption, usage, responsibilities, risk assessment, monitoring and compliance requirements.', 'Cloud security policy, cloud architecture diagrams, landing zone guardrails, CSPM reports, cloud control baseline and architecture/security review approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1268', 'IT', 'Cloud Security', 'Cloud Security Principles', 'Mechanisms exist to apply cloud security principles covering shared responsibility, data protection, access control, logging, monitoring, resilience and supplier assurance.', 'Cloud security policy, cloud architecture diagrams, landing zone guardrails, CSPM reports, cloud control baseline and architecture/security review approvals.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1269', 'IT', 'Availability & DDoS Protection', 'DDoS Protection & Traffic Scrubbing', 'Mechanisms exist to detect, absorb, rate-limit and redirect volumetric, protocol and application-layer denial-of-service attacks against internet-facing services and supporting APIs.', 'DDoS protection design, scrubbing provider/SLA, traffic baseline, WAF/rate-limit policy, test report, DDoS alert sample and incident runbook.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1270', 'IT', 'Digital Channel Protection', 'Bot Management & Anti-Automation', 'Mechanisms exist to detect and limit automated abuse such as credential stuffing, scraping, fake account creation, inventory/slot hoarding, spam submissions and workflow abuse.', 'Bot-management policy, rule configuration, rate-limit thresholds, CAPTCHA/challenge logs, blocked bot sample, exception list and tuning review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1271', 'IT', 'Identity & SaaS Security', 'OAuth Consent & Token Governance', 'Mechanisms exist to restrict, approve, monitor and revoke OAuth applications, refresh tokens, delegated permissions and API consents for SaaS and identity platforms.', 'OAuth app inventory, admin consent workflow, approved scopes list, token lifetime policy, risky app alert, revoked token evidence and periodic review report.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1272', 'IT', 'Session Security', 'Session Token Protection', 'Mechanisms exist to protect session cookies, access tokens and refresh tokens through secure storage, short-lived sessions, device binding where feasible and detection of anomalous token reuse.', 'Session security standard, cookie/token configuration, token lifetime policy, impossible-travel/token replay alert, revocation record and test result.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1273', 'IT', 'Secrets & Machine Identity', 'Secrets Management & API Key Protection', 'Mechanisms exist to centrally store, rotate, monitor and revoke secrets, API keys, certificates, service credentials and machine identities used by applications and integrations.', 'Secrets vault configuration, key inventory, rotation logs, source-code secret scan result, emergency revocation record, service account review and exception approval.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1274', 'IT', 'Fraud & Social Engineering', 'Deepfake & Payment Instruction Verification', 'Mechanisms exist to verify high-risk instructions and identity claims received through voice, video, messaging or email, including deepfake-resistant callback and dual-approval procedures.', 'Deepfake/social engineering procedure, call-back matrix, dual approval logs, payment/change-of-bank validation evidence, awareness material and simulation result.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1275', 'IT', 'Email & Domain Security', 'DMARC, DKIM & SPF Enforcement', 'Mechanisms exist to authenticate outbound email domains, reject spoofed messages and monitor domain abuse through SPF, DKIM, DMARC and lookalike-domain detection.', 'SPF/DKIM/DMARC records, enforcement policy, aggregate report sample, domain monitoring alert, remediation ticket and exception approval.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1276', 'IT', 'API Security', 'Public API Security Gateway', 'Mechanisms exist to protect public and partner APIs through gateway enforcement, authentication, authorization, schema validation, rate-limiting, logging and abuse detection.', 'API inventory, gateway policy, authentication/authorization rule, schema validation setting, rate-limit logs, API test results and exception register.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1277', 'IT', 'AI / LLM Security', 'LLM Prompt Injection Protection', 'Mechanisms exist to assess and mitigate prompt injection, jailbreaks and indirect prompt attacks against LLM-enabled applications, including input filtering, isolation and response validation.', 'LLM use-case approval, prompt injection test cases, guardrail configuration, blocked prompt sample, red-team report, remediation ticket and model owner sign-off.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1278', 'IT', 'AI / LLM Security', 'LLM Output & Data Disclosure Controls', 'Mechanisms exist to prevent LLM-enabled tools from exposing sensitive information, system prompts, credentials, regulated data or unauthorized retrieved content.', 'Data access policy for LLM, retrieval access rules, output filtering/DLP settings, sensitive output test, incident log and approval record.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1279', 'IT', 'AI Agent Security', 'AI Agent Tool Permission Guardrails', 'Mechanisms exist to constrain AI agents and automation tools through least privilege, approved tool registry, human approval for high-risk actions and detailed action logging.', 'AI agent tool registry, permission matrix, human approval workflow, action log sample, blocked high-risk action, access review and exception record.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1280', 'IT', 'AI / Data Integrity', 'AI Training Data & Retrieval Integrity', 'Mechanisms exist to protect AI training data, prompts, embeddings, retrieval stores and model artifacts from poisoning, unauthorized modification or untrusted source injection.', 'Approved data-source register, data lineage record, retrieval index change log, model artifact integrity check, poisoning test result and owner approval.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1281', 'IT', 'SaaS Security', 'SaaS Tenant Security Baseline', 'Mechanisms exist to baseline, monitor and harden SaaS tenants including identity federation, admin roles, external sharing, audit logging, integrations and conditional access.', 'SaaS baseline checklist, tenant configuration export, admin role review, external sharing report, audit log proof, SSPM/CASB finding and remediation tracker.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1282', 'IT', 'Third-Party Resilience', 'Vendor-Hosted Service Cyber Resilience', 'Mechanisms exist to assess and monitor vendor-hosted platforms for cyber resilience, incident notification, recovery commitments, security logging, access controls and service continuity.', 'Vendor risk assessment, contract/SLA clause, SOC/assurance report, DR test attestation, incident notification clause, service review minutes and risk action tracker.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1283', 'IT', 'Cloud Data Protection', 'Cloud Object Storage Exposure Guardrails', 'Mechanisms exist to prevent unauthorized exposure of cloud buckets, object storage, collaboration folders and public sharing links through policy, scanning and automated remediation.', 'Cloud storage policy, public access block setting, storage scan report, DLP alert, remediation ticket, sharing exception and periodic review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1284', 'IT', 'Ransomware Resilience', 'Ransomware Recovery & Immutable Backup Controls', 'Mechanisms exist to protect recovery capability from ransomware through immutable/offline backups, privileged backup access controls, restore testing and backup destruction alerts.', 'Immutable backup configuration, backup admin access review, restore test result, backup deletion alert, isolated recovery design and recovery exercise evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1285', 'IT', 'Remote Access Security', 'Remote Monitoring & Management Tool Governance', 'Mechanisms exist to inventory, approve, restrict, monitor and disable remote monitoring and management tools, remote support tools and third-party administrative utilities.', 'Approved RMM tool inventory, blocked tool list, remote session logs, admin approval, EDR detection rule, vendor access review and removal evidence.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1286', 'IT', 'Identity Threat Detection', 'Identity Threat Detection & Response', 'Mechanisms exist to detect and respond to identity attacks including impossible travel, risky sign-ins, token replay, MFA fatigue, abnormal privilege use and suspicious OAuth activity.', 'Identity detection use cases, alert sample, investigation ticket, risky sign-in report, token revocation evidence, playbook and post-incident review.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1287', 'IT', 'Identification & Authentication', 'Phishing-Resistant MFA and Passkeys', 'Mechanisms exist to enforce phishing-resistant authentication such as FIDO2/passkeys, certificate-backed authentication or equivalent controls for privileged and high-risk access.', 'Phishing-resistant MFA policy, FIDO/passkey enrolment report, privileged account coverage, exception approval, authentication logs and rollout plan.', 'seed_script'),
        ('CII-CID-1288', 'IT', 'Security Awareness & Training', 'AI-Enabled Social Engineering Awareness', 'Mechanisms exist to train personnel to detect and report AI-enabled phishing, deepfake impersonation, malicious QR codes, SMS/voice scams and fraudulent payment or approval instructions.', 'Awareness content, targeted campaign record, deepfake/QR phishing simulation result, user reporting statistics, corrective action plan and role-based training attendance.', 'seed_script');
END
